# EyeCanSee
===
A viewer and manager for photos, videos, 3D models and CAD drawings, with an image editor, for Linux and Windows, written in Rust.

- Browse folders, disks, SFTP/FTP servers and Android phones, with thumbnails.
- Convert pictures and videos, find duplicates, annotate images and cover private data.
- Copy and move files between folders, disks, servers and phones.

The AppImage is the official one from the project's GitHub releases, with a minisign signature for every file.
